# VeriFace 🔐
### AI-Powered Smart Door Security System

> A full-stack IoT security platform that combines face recognition, QR guest access, live CCTV streaming, and hardware door control — installable as a mobile PWA.

---

## What Is This?

VeriFace is a smart door security system you can actually build and deploy at home. It turns any Android/iPhone into a security panel for your door — with face recognition that automatically unlocks when it sees you, a live camera feed, QR codes for guests, and a full access log.

Built with Django, InsightFace ArcFace (state-of-the-art face recognition), OpenCV, and Arduino for hardware control.

---

## Features

- **Face Recognition Door Unlock** — ArcFace 512-d embeddings with cosine similarity. Enrolls from a single photo. Auto-opens door, auto-closes after 5 seconds.
- **Live CCTV Feed** — MJPEG stream at 30 FPS. Supports any IP camera app (DroidCam, IP Webcam, AirDroid) or laptop webcam.
- **Manual Door Control** — Toggle door open/close from anywhere via the app.
- **QR Guest Access** — Generate encrypted, time-limited QR codes for guests. Per-QR Fernet encryption keys. Device-scoped so QRs only work on your door.
- **Access Logs** — Every face detection, QR scan, and manual action logged with photo and timestamp.
- **Camera Blocked Alerts** — Detects when camera is physically covered. Sends push notification + in-app banner.
- **Web Push Notifications** — VAPID-based push via browser. Works even when app is closed.
- **PWA — Installable on Phone** — Works as a native-feeling app on Android and iPhone. Portrait-only, mobile-first design.
- **Multi-User Household** — Up to 5 family members per device. First member is owner (admin rights), rest are members.
- **Owner Controls** — Only owner can generate guest QRs and revoke access.
- **Simulation Mode** — Runs without Arduino hardware. Door commands print to terminal.
- **SQLite or PostgreSQL** — Switch via `.env`. SQLite works out of the box for demos.

---

## System Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        INPUT LAYER                          │
│  IP Camera / Webcam → CameraManager (singleton reader thread)│
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ frames
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          ▼                ▼                ▼
   Live Feed (30fps)  Recognition     QR Scanner
   MJPEG Stream       Pipeline (2fps)  (10fps)
   → Browser          │                │
                      ▼                ▼
              InsightFace ArcFace   Fernet Decrypt
              Cosine Similarity     Expiry Check
              threshold: 0.5        Device Scope
                      │                │
                      └────────┬───────┘
                               ▼
                        DoorController
                        (singleton)
                       /            \
               Arduino Serial     Simulation
               OPEN/CLOSE         Terminal Print
                       \            /
                        AccessLog DB
                           │
                        Logs Page

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    NOTIFICATION LAYER                        │
│  Camera Monitor → blocked/offline → Web Push (VAPID)        │
│                                  → In-App Banner            │
│  Face Match    → door opened     → Push all family members  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    AUTH / ENROLLMENT                         │
│  Verify Device Key → Register → Upload Face Photo           │
│  → InsightFace Embedding → 512-d .npy file saved            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | Django 5.2, Python 3.10 |
| Face Recognition | InsightFace ArcFace (buffalo_l), ONNX Runtime |
| Computer Vision | OpenCV |
| Hardware | Arduino Uno + door lock relay |
| Database | SQLite (default) / PostgreSQL |
| Encryption | Fernet (cryptography library) |
| Push Notifications | Web Push API + VAPID (pywebpush) |
| Camera | Any MJPEG stream — DroidCam, IP Webcam, AirDroid, or laptop webcam |
| Frontend | Django Templates, Vanilla CSS/JS, PWA |
| Fonts | Syne, JetBrains Mono, Inter |

