## Data Flow Diagrams

### Level 0 — Context Diagram

```
                    ┌─────────────────┐
Face Photo ──────► │                 │ ◄──── Product Key
Login Creds ─────► │                 │
Manual Toggle ───► │   VERIFACE      │ ────► Live Feed
                   │   SYSTEM        │ ────► Access Logs
Family Member ◄──  │                 │ ────► Push Notifications
                   │                 │ ────► Door Status
                   └────────┬────────┘
                            │
          ┌─────────────────┼──────────────────┐
          ▼                 ▼                  ▼
    IP Camera          Arduino HW        Push Service
    (video in)      (OPEN/CLOSE cmds)  (Google/Apple FCM)
```

### Level 1 — Internal Processes

```
Family Member
     │
     ├──[product key]──► 1.0 Authenticate ──► D1: Users & Profiles
     │                        │
     │                   [session token]
     │
     ├──[video stream]──► 2.0 Stream Camera ──► Browser
     │
     ├──[face frames]──► 3.0 Recognize Face ──► D2: Face Embeddings (.npy)
     │                        │                 D3: Access Logs
     │                   [match signal]
     │
     ├──[qr scan]──────► 4.0 Scan QR Code ──► D4: Guest QRs
     │                        │                D3: Access Logs
     │                   [valid signal]
     │
     ├──[manual tap]──► 5.0 Control Door ──► Arduino Hardware
     │                       │               D3: Access Logs
     │                  [door state]
     │
     └──[request]──────► 6.0 Manage Guests ──► D4: Guest QRs
                              │
                         [qr image]
```

